    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41872" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπουρ-ιάζω</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὖρος</span>) of a fair wind, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>waft onwards,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἀκάτια</span>”
